User Story: Initial Improvements to VoiceOver / TalkBack – Accessibility
Task: Conduct User Testing

Overview:
As a tester, I facilitated user testing with individuals who rely on VoiceOver (iOS) and TalkBack (Android) to navigate the application. 
Testing focused on assessing the accuracy of spoken feedback, ease of navigation, and overall user experience. Participants confirmed
that accessibility features were functional and intuitive, with feedback highlighting minor areas for refinement to enhance usability.
